# Copy to .env to change these. Everything here is optional.

# ---- Graphing calculator (Desmos) ----
# Math questions have a Desmos calculator (practice player, diagnostic test, mock exams, Daily Star).
# With nothing set, it shows the page Desmos runs for the digital SAT in a frame:
# https://www.desmos.com/testing/cb-digital-sat/graphing
# With a key, it uses Desmos's own embedding API instead, which is what Desmos asks products to use.
# Get a key at https://www.desmos.com/my-api and rebuild (the key is read at build time, and it also
# widens the page's content security policy: see vite.config.js).
# VITE_DESMOS_API_KEY=
